  "panel": "<div class=\" installation-snippet bg-alt-dark-purple flex flex-col gap-4 overflow-scroll max-w-[59.3125rem] w-full\" id=\"python\" data-docs-url=\"https://docs.sentry.io/platforms/python/\" data-astro-cid-lifyow4k=\"\"><p>Grab the <a href=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python\">Sentry Python SDK</a>:</p>\n<div class=\"code-wrapper\" data-copy-bound=\"true\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-language\">Bash</span><span class=\"code-header-actions\"><span class=\"hasCopiedCodeMessage\" role=\"status\"></span><button class=\"copyCodeButton\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 1H4C2.9 1 2 1.9 2 3V17H4V3H16V1ZM19 5H8C6.9 5 6 5.9 6 7V21C6 22.1 6.9 23 8 23H19C20.1 23 21 22.1 21 21V7C21 5.9 20.1 5 19 5ZM19 21H8V7H19V21Z\" fill=\"white\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> --upgrade</span><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> sentry-sdk</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Configure your DSN:</p>\n<div class=\"code-wrapper\" data-copy-bound=\"true\"><div class=\"code-header\"><span class=\"code-language\">Python</span><span class=\"code-header-actions\"><span class=\"hasCopiedCodeMessage\" role=\"status\"></span><button class=\"copyCodeButton\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M16 1H4C2.9 1 2 1.9 2 3V17H4V3H16V1ZM19 5H8C6.9 5 6 5.9 6 7V21C6 22.1 6.9 23 8 23H19C20.1 23 21 22.1 21 21V7C21 5.9 20.1 5 19 5ZM19 21H8V7H19V21Z\" fill=\"white\"></path></svg></button></span></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> sentry_sdk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">sentry_sdk.init(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">    \"https://&lt;key&gt;@sentry.io/&lt;project&gt;\"</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # Set traces_sample_rate to 1.0 to capture 100%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # of transactions for Tracing.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D\">    # We recommend adjusting this value in production.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">    enable_tracing</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#FFAB70\">    traces_sample_rate</span><span style=\"color:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div></div>",
